--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Protocol references (no code copied)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Apple Music source was written from the behaviour publicly observable in the Apple
Music web player: the site's index script carries a short-lived developer JWT, and the
catalog API accepts that JWT. No code, no resources and no tokens from any third-party
plugin repository were copied; in particular, Replica0110/Lyrico-Plugins declares no
licence, so only its documented protocol surface informed this implementation.

Replica0110/Lyrico (Apache-2.0) was read for layout and field-routing ideas (row metrics,
typed picture kinds, tag alias rules). Any such influence is re-expressed in this
project's own architecture and tested independently; see docs/UI.md and docs/SOURCES.md.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Not included
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project contains no code, resources, native libraries or cryptographic keys from
com.xjcheng.musictageditor 1.2.5.2. Service endpoint URLs and protocol details were
reimplemented from publicly documented network behaviour; the tag engine uses upstream
TagLib rather than the original app's binary.
